WEBVTT

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:10.740
Who'll win in the end, do you think? 
The Desert Apostles, or those Precure?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.290
I care not.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.240
My, my.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.240
All I seek is to heighten my own strength.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.950
Defeating the Precure is but a part of that.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.710
It's that simple.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.750
I see.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.710
And all I seek is the pursuit of greater beauty.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.840
Then do as you wish.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:36.050
Of course. Such is my intent.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.000
Dark Precure.

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:13.170
HeartCatch

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.630
Precure!

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.220
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.180
Now, all together

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:23.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.690
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:34.320
Within each of our chests,

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.990
they begin to sprout

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.660
The seeds of the heart

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:39.910
are growing

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.530
bit by bit

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.200
Red,

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:43.820
white

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.120
and yellow

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.870
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.330
all varied colors

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.810
that they

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.960
shine so brightly!

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.300
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:00.800
with such care

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.520
will never wither

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.100
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.980
Now, all together

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.440
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.110
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:19.990
They're always right by our sides

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:20.820
So together

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:24.660
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.620
bloom even more!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.170
HeartCatch

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.680
Precure!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.120
What are you doing?

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:57.820
You're acting shuper weird!

00:02:58.730 --> 00:02:59.950
We're imitating Yuri!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.370
Imitating me?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.270
What on earth for?

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:07.200
You're just so cool and mature!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:11.080
Even just watering the flowers, you move with such delicacy and grace.

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:13.240
Exactly!

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:16.250
I wish I was that graceful.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.640
You really think so?

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.250
It's not something I do consciously, I assure you.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.970
Thank you all for your help.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.350
It looks lovely!

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.800
Time to eat!

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.360
Someone's outside.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.830
They ran off.

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:48.090
Who could it have been?

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:50.430
What's this?

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:53.920
A love letter?!

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:57.760
Whoa! An actual love letter!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:08.260
Yuri's Lost at Sea<i>!</i>

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:08.260
Yuri's Lost at Sea<i>!</i>

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.780
I've never seen an honest-to-god love letter before!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:16.270
It doesn't say who it's from or who it's for.

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.040
Should we open it?

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.740
I think that would be incredibly impolite.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.720
Yeah, I know.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.240
I'm sorry.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.790
Well, we can keep it here at the gardens for the time being.

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:35.280
Huh?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.460
"I've alwaysh loved you ever..."

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.680
No, Potpourri!

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.000
Why not?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.760
I wanna shee what it saysh!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.840
Okay, let's shee.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:52.560
"I've alwaysh loved you ever shince we firsht met..."

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.510
A-Always l-l-loved them?!

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.590
They're very direct, at least.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:58.690
Yeah...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:03.000
Wh-What if it's for me?! Oh gosh, I can't deal with this!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.630
It can't be for you.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.360
Huh?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.840
It says "always loved you."

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:11.160
<i>You</i> only moved here in the spring.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.980
It must be for Ichuki!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.170
Because everyone loves Ichuki!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.000
All the <i>girls</i> do, yeah.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:28.090
It seems Cupid is finally taking a shine to me.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.960
What if it's for Yuri?!

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.350
Yeah, don't mind me.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.360
I have to prepare dinner tonight,

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.610
so if you'll excuse me.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.280
Where is it?

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.110
I know I dropped it around here.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.020
Are you looking for this?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.870
G-Give that back!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.880
Um...

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.340
I'm really sorry.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:16.960
We kind of read your letter.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:21.360
So, who is it you have a crush on?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.570
Could it be...

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:24.690
me?

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:26.200
Huh?!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:29.360
I'm not interested in brats like you.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.430
Brats?!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:32.330
Then...

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.790
is it for me?

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:36.000
Wha—?!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.510
Oh, she's a girl, really!

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:40.800
O-Oh, okay.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.310
I thought you were Yuri's boyfriend or something.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.460
Yuri's?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.260
Wait, was that love letter for...

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.510
Yuri?!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:54.590
Hayato, we're really sorry we read your love letter.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:56.520
It was sort of an accident.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.980
Don't worry! We won't tell Yuri!

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:04.110
So now we've got that out the way, tell us all about it!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.440
What is it you like about Yuri?

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.070
Erika...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.540
I'm not telling you!

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.210
Why the heck not?

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.910
You've <i>always</i> loved her, right?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.040
Jeez!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.550
Can it, Erika!

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:18.670
What'd I do?!

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:22.290
I think I know how you must feel, Hayato.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:26.570
We all admire Yuri a lot too, in our own way.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.050
So you've known Yuri a long time then, Hayato?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.470
Yeah.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.870
We lived in the same apartments, so we used to play together a lot.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.990
Oh, so <i>that's</i> why.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.190
Hey.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:46.610
Do you know why Yuri's been so much happier lately?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.910
Well, um...

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.820
A lot of different things have happened.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.900
Anyway, it's good that she's happy again, isn't it?

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:56.750
Yeah.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.460
Hayato?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:08.590
Ever since her dad vanished, Yuri's always been so upset.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:14.160
I couldn't do anything to cheer her up, either.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.540
I'm just a kid, after all.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.790
Hayato...

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:29.450
But I wanna make sure Yuri never has to feel sad again!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.990
You're a real man, Hayato!

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:36.880
So that's why you wanted to give Yuri that love letter!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:37.720
Yeah.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.970
In that case, let us help!

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:41.750
Wha—?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:46.070
We'll set everything up so you can give Yuri your love letter!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.630
It's the least we can do to apologize for reading it.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.710
What do you think?

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:51.750
Okay?

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.670
Uh...

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.930
Well, uh... sure!

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.110
A strategy meeting?

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:18.970
Well, it <i>is</i> true that we need to prepare for the Desert Apostles' next attack.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:23.260
All right, I'll meet you after school.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:24.160
Okay!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.850
Y-Yuri...

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.620
Hayato!

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.060
Testing, testing, do you read me, over?

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.980
Loud and clear, over!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.280
It's been a while.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.140
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.950
They're being really awkward, over.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.680
S-So Yuri, what have you been doing lately?

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.400
You've seemed really busy.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.140
Lately? Well, I...

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.930
It's been hectic.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:27.930
Why?

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.630
Can't you tell me?

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.980
I'm sorry. It's... tricky.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:35.310
What, is it because I'm a kid?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.080
Yuri, I want you to—

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.160
Hey, do you remember?

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:47.000
We used to play here all the time.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.300
Playing tag or hide-and-seek...

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:56.470
You always used to fall asleep while you were waiting for me to find you.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.050
That was ages ago!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.500
Really? I remember it like it was just yesterday.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:10.550
They're talking about when Hayato was younger!

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:14.730
Yuri sheems to be enjoying it,
 but Hayato looksh bored, over!

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:17.850
Make them quit the reminiscing, over!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:21.680
Can you get them to change the subject, over?

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.280
You're fairies, right?

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:27.440
Use some miracle magic superpower or something, over!

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:30.000
<i>Don't ask the impossible, over!</i>

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:33.010
I'm so glad you were there for me, Hayato.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:39.470
I don't have any siblings, so I always thought of you as the younger brother I never had.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.970
I... I don't...

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:50.310
I don't want to be your little brother!

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.270
Hayato?!

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.980
His heart was stolen by an older girl.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.740
The Flower of his Heart wilts before my very eyes.

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:16.550
Just what I'm looking for.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:25.010
I shall take the Flower of your Heart!

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:29.060
Flower of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.010
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:53.040
Love letter!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.710
A Desertrian?!

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.230
Precure!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.720
Open My Heart!

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:37.790
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.300
Cure Moonlight!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:52.630
Why couldn't I have been born a few years earlier?!

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.740
I just want to be an adult!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.230
Love me!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.410
Sunflower Aegis!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:12.740
Letter?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.080
You came!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.310
They turned Hayato into the Desertrian!{NO WHO COULD HAVE GUESSED}

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.410
Here you are, Precure.

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.920
Get them, Desertrian!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.260
Love letter!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.390
Love, love! Letter, letter!

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:51.200
I don't want her to treat me like a little kid!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:02.380
I don't wanna be Yuri's little brother!

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.840
Why, Hayato? Why don't you?

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.420
Jeez, you're dense!

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:11.710
Yuri, it's because Hayato is actually—

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.470
It's not your place to say it, Marine!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.730
It's up to Hayato to tell Yuri in his own words!

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.810
Oh, but that will never happen, I assure you.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.780
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.140
Dark Bracelet!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.660
It's time we finished this once and for all, Precure!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.350
Exquisite!

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:05.730
Kobraja! What is it you're fighting for?!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.260
What am I fighting for?

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:10.550
All I care about is beauty! {not as catchy sorry there, Kobraja}

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:13.060
But what is beautiful about the human heart?

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:16.990
It falters, it feels pain, and it 
gives in to hatred and jealousy!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.700
It possesses not a shred of beauty!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:23.200
The human heart has no place in the world of wilted hearts,

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.960
a world of true beauty that the Desert Apostles shall create!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.910
That is beauty beyond compare.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:31.430
Not that I would expect you to understand.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.490
Kobraja,

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.660
you're totally wrong!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:55.700
What makes us able to truly appreciate beauty is the very thing you say we don't need!

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:57.320
Our hearts!

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:02.800
The heart is useless!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:06.080
You disgust me, Precure!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.250
Come on!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.040
Right! {beam spam time}

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.860
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.290
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:55.240
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.690
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:11.380
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.930
I can't let them purify me!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:57.400
Now's our chance!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:39.190
No way... Dark Precure's back?!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.910
And she's way stronger than before!

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:56.990
Are you okay?

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.010
Y-Yeah.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:05.760
I'm sorry, Hayato.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:11.850
I just thought of you like a little brother 
without realizing how much it upset you.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.800
N-No...

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:16.940
That wasn't what I wanted to say!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.760
I want you to have this!

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.120
Th-Thank you.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.000
But I...

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.020
It's okay.

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.630
I just wanted you to know how I felt.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:59.950
I'm gonna eat all my veggies, get lots of sleep, and become a big strong adult!

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.820
I'll become the kind of man who can make sure you never feel sad again!

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:07.870
Okay.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:12.060
He's a man! He's a real man, that Hayato!

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:19.710
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:34.060
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:39.790
In the language of flowers, a cherry means "young love."

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:43.610
Exactly the feelings Hayato has for Yuri.

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:46.470
Well, everyone loves Yuri! {all these phrases}

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:02.460
<i>She really is incredible.</i>

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.990
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:25.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:32.620
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:38.210
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:47.180
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:53.890
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.360
All those

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:08.940
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.200
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.870
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:21.090
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:27.220
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.600
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.770
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:45.820
<i>Whenever I've felt sad wanted to cry,</i>

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:49.400
<i>my family's smiles have always helped cheer me up.</i>

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:50.990
<i>They mean the world to me.</i>

00:23:51.810 --> 00:23:54.660
<i>And now, that family is about to grow a little bigger.</i>

00:23:55.390 --> 00:23:59.440
<i>And it's my job to be the best big sister I can for the new baby!</i>

00:24:01.070 --> 00:24:02.540
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

